                                        "entry_id": "ceebc216-60f5-3d09-a485-fc12ea64657a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The fear of staircases or of falling down stairs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a54fca0-9173-40bb-8da0-4c3f011d4d10",
                                                "sense_id": "ea6d9c0f-f64f-3389-93c7-6d04edf5ca7b",
                                                "text": "Lucy: Are you afraid of staircases? If you are, then you have climacophobia."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1c9d010-d304-4429-b359-8a527b663ce8",
                                                "sense_id": "ea6d9c0f-f64f-3389-93c7-6d04edf5ca7b",
                                                "text": "I myself have recently developed mild climacophobia (fear of falling downstairs). Don't know why, but I'm convinced that someday I'll fall down a flight of stairs and hurt myself badly."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c18292c-0d04-493a-932b-d8cc723f877e",
                                                "sense_id": "ea6d9c0f-f64f-3389-93c7-6d04edf5ca7b",
                                                "text": "I once knew a tall kyphophobic man,\nWho was sick of stooping so low;\nSadly he developed climacophobia,\nWhen he moved from his bungalow."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
